Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 18:45:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/26] feat: add CryPhoneTracker plugin (ARCore phone 6DoF +
 lens control)

Entity component receiving pose and lens packets over UDP from the
Android ARCore tracker app. Drives the entity transform (origin/yaw/
scale/offset mapping, recenter without teleport) and forwards phone
fader values (focal length, aperture, focus distance, EV, DOF/exposure
switches) to a CinematicCamera component on the same entity through the
runtime-resolved CryGetCinematicCameraOptics entry point - no link
dependency, works standalone without the camera plugin.

Includes the PoseFilter pipeline (PoseFilterSpec.md): phone-timestamp
clock rebasing, One Euro adaptive filtering at packet rate, fixed-delay
Hermite resampling at render rate, and a virtual-tripod state machine
that freezes the frame bit-exact while composing and blends back out on
motion. Filter Mode Off preserves the unfiltered legacy path.

